          "visual_description_long": "The scene opens with a first-person view of a sandstone wall on de_dust2, likely near the CT spawn area. A sharp diagonal shadow bisects the wall from the top-left to the bottom-right, creating a strong contrast between the sunlit right side and the shadowed left side. On the right, a vertical corner of the sandstone structure is visible, hinting at an opening or lane just out of view. The ground is a stone-paved floor, mostly obscured by the viewmodel. In the lower right corner, an AWP sniper rifle is held in a ready position, showing its olive-green body, scope, and barrel. The background consists of weathered plaster and stone walls. The lighting is bright outdoor sunlight, casting a sharp shadow. There is no camera movement or player locomotion.",
